{"id":"wb-5-324","name":"天中万寿塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"天中万寿塔","text":"天中万寿塔位于中国福建省仙游县枫亭镇塔斗山，又称青螺塔，属于宝箧印式塔，建于北宋嘉祐四年（1059年），2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n天中万寿塔以花岗岩条石砌成，实心，底座正方形，边长7.8米。底座上为三层须弥座，第一层雕有龙，第二层雕有梅兰竹菊，第三层雕有佛像和力士像。塔顶四角为蕉叶形插角，塔刹为五重相轮。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%87%E5%AF%BF%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86557296,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86557296","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/000c8865a633b8b8d2621879.jpg","title":"天中万寿塔_国保立碑.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A9%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%87%E5%AF%BF%E5%A1%94_%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%AB%8B%E7%A2%91.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8d/%E5%A4%A9%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%87%E5%AF%BF%E5%A1%94_%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%AB%8B%E7%A2%91.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"三猎","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​天中万寿塔，国保立碑。","width":320,"height":481}}